exports[`the notification pages' markup is unchanged > the web push page, configured and not configured 2`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthLg css-5c1adp-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">Web Push</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-9ebprp-MuiTypography-root">Generate a VAPID key pair, enable or rotate it, and control whether this deployment can send browser push notifications. (read-only)</p><section class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-srvwji-MuiPaper-root" aria-labelledby="push-generate-heading" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root" id="push-generate-heading">Generate a key pair</h6><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-956xpl-MuiTypography-root">Creates a new VAPID key pair and switches web push on immediately. This is a one-time action for a fresh deployment — once a key pair exists, use Rotate to replace it.</p><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-dzmwfx-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary Mui-disabled MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-outlined css-19qnlrw-MuiFormLabel-root-MuiInputLabel-root" data-shrink="false" for="_rX_" id="_rX_-label">Subject (contact address)</label><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiOutlinedInput-root MuiInputBase-colorPrimary Mui-disabled MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl css-1blp12k-MuiInputBase-root-MuiOutlinedInput-root"><in